    of shape ``(..., m, n)``, and ``posdef`` is the positive-semidefinite
    factor. ``posdef`` has shape ``(..., n, n)`` or ``(..., m, m)`` depending
    on whether ``side`` is ``"right"`` or ``"left"``, respectively.

